{"seq":2,"slug":"communication-efficiency","title":"通信效率与压缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/federated-privacy-ml/systems/communication-efficiency","wordCount":1465,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"通信效率与压缩\">通信效率与压缩</h1><p>在机房里训练，通信跑在 InfiniBand 上，几乎不要钱。在 <a href=\"cross-device-silo\">跨设备</a> 联邦里，通信跑在用户的移动网络上，且是最贵的那段——上行带宽。一个现代模型动辄几十上百 MB，让上亿部手机每轮都上传一遍完整模型，既烧用户流量、又拖垮训练。所以通信效率不是锦上添花，而是跨设备联邦能否成立的生死线。这一篇讲清为什么通信是瓶颈，以及量化、稀疏化、低秩三类压缩手段的原理与代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>要理解为什么省通信这么重要，先把一轮 <a href=\"../foundations/fedavg\">FedAvg</a> 的通信账算清。每轮通信量 = 参与客户端数 × 单客户端上下行的模型大小。下行（服务器发模型）通常不是瓶颈——服务器带宽充足、且可广播；真正卡脖子的是<strong>上行</strong>：每个客户端要把和模型同样大的更新传回，而家用网络的上行带宽往往只有下行的几分之一。</p>\n<p>减少总通信量有两个正交的旋钮：<strong>减少轮次</strong>和<strong>压缩每轮的量</strong>。FedAvg 的本地多步训练已经在拧第一个旋钮（用本地计算换轮次）。这一篇专注第二个旋钮——在不显著伤害精度的前提下，把每次上传的更新压小。</p>\n<p>下表对照三类压缩手段，它们可以叠加使用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>典型压缩比</th>\n<th>主要代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>量化</td>\n<td>降低每个参数的比特数</td>\n<td>4x–32x</td>\n<td>量化误差，需误差反馈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稀疏化</td>\n<td>只传部分参数</td>\n<td>10x–100x</td>\n<td>选择开销，收敛变慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低秩分解</td>\n<td>把更新近似成低秩矩阵积</td>\n<td>取决于秩</td>\n<td>表达能力受限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"量化-用更少比特表示每个数\">量化：用更少比特表示每个数</h2><p>量化的思路最直接：模型参数默认用 32 位浮点，但更新里其实没那么多有效信息，把每个数压到 8 位、4 位甚至 1 位（只传符号），通信量按比例下降。最激进的是 <strong>SignSGD</strong>——只传每个梯度分量的符号，单参数压到 1 比特，理论压缩 32 倍。</p>\n<p>量化的核心难题是<strong>误差累积</strong>：每轮丢掉的精度会一轮轮攒下来，最终伤害收敛。标准解法是<strong>误差反馈</strong>（error feedback）：客户端把这轮量化丢掉的残差记下来，加到下一轮的更新里补偿，让误差不会无限累积。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{\\Delta}_t = Q(\\Delta_t + e_{t-1}), \\quad e_t = (\\Delta_t + e_{t-1}) - \\tilde{\\Delta}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0702em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0702em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是量化算子，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是累积残差。误差反馈让 1-bit 量化也能逼近全精度的收敛效果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"稀疏化与低秩\">稀疏化与低秩</h2><p>稀疏化比量化更激进：不是压缩每个数，而是<strong>干脆只传一部分数</strong>。最常用的是 Top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 稀疏化——每轮只上传更新里绝对值最大的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个分量，其余置零不传。因为深度模型的梯度天然稀疏（大部分分量接近零），只传最大的 1% 往往就能保住大部分信息，压缩比可达百倍。稀疏化同样需要误差反馈来累积那些「这轮没传」的小分量，避免它们永远被忽略。</p>\n<p>低秩分解则利用「更新矩阵常常近似低秩」这一结构：把一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m \\times n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的更新矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 近似成两个瘦矩阵的积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">UV^\\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m\\times r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\times r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，秩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m,n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>），只传 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>。通信量从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mn</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mn</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r(m+n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这与大模型微调里的 LoRA 思想同源，在联邦微调大模型时尤其有效。</p>\n<p>下图把三类压缩放进 FedAvg 的上行环节，展示它们都作用在「客户端上传前」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[客户端本地训练得更新 delta] --&gt;|压缩前| B{选择压缩手段}&#10;  B --&gt;|量化| Q[降比特 + 误差反馈]&#10;  B --&gt;|稀疏化| S[Top-k 只传最大分量 + 误差反馈]&#10;  B --&gt;|低秩| L[分解成 U V 转置 只传瘦矩阵]&#10;  Q --&gt;|压缩后上传| AGG[服务器解压并聚合]&#10;  S --&gt;|压缩后上传| AGG&#10;  L --&gt;|压缩后上传| AGG&#10;  AGG --&gt;|进入下一轮| A\">flowchart TD\n  A[客户端本地训练得更新 delta] --&gt;|压缩前| B{选择压缩手段}\n  B --&gt;|量化| Q[降比特 + 误差反馈]\n  B --&gt;|稀疏化| S[Top-k 只传最大分量 + 误差反馈]\n  B --&gt;|低秩| L[分解成 U V 转置 只传瘦矩阵]\n  Q --&gt;|压缩后上传| AGG[服务器解压并聚合]\n  S --&gt;|压缩后上传| AGG\n  L --&gt;|压缩后上传| AGG\n  AGG --&gt;|进入下一轮| A</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# Top-k 稀疏化 + 误差反馈 概念示意&#10;def topk_compress(delta, residual, k):&#10;    corrected = delta + residual          # 先补上上轮残差&#10;    mask = topk_mask(corrected, k)        # 选出绝对值最大的 k 个分量&#10;    sparse = corrected * mask&#10;    new_residual = corrected - sparse     # 没传的部分留到下轮&#10;    return sparse, new_residual\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Top-k 稀疏化 + 误差反馈 概念示意</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> topk_compress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(delta, residual, k):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    corrected </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> residual          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 先补上上轮残差</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> topk_mask(corrected, k)        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 选出绝对值最大的 k 个分量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sparse </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> corrected </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mask</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    new_residual </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> corrected </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sparse     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 没传的部分留到下轮</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sparse, new_residual</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"压缩与隐私的纠缠\">压缩与隐私的纠缠</h2><p>通信压缩看似纯工程问题，却和隐私章深度纠缠——这是本篇最值得警惕的一点。</p>\n<p>第一重纠缠：<strong>压缩与差分隐私的噪声预算相互拉扯</strong>。<a href=\"../privacy/differential-privacy\">差分隐私</a> 要往更新里加噪，而量化和稀疏化也在「扰动」更新。两者叠加时，加噪后的更新再被量化，量化误差和隐私噪声会相互影响；设计不当会让有效噪声偏离标定值、破坏 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 保证。正确做法是把量化纳入隐私会计一起分析，而非先加噪再随手量化。</p>\n<p>第二重纠缠：<strong>压缩与安全聚合的兼容性</strong>。<a href=\"../privacy/secure-aggregation\">安全聚合</a> 的成对掩码要求所有客户端的更新在同一个固定维度的向量空间里相加。但 Top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 稀疏化让每个客户端传的分量位置都不同，破坏了这个对齐前提，掩码无法两两抵消。所以稀疏化和安全聚合天然冲突，要么改用对齐的稀疏模式、要么放弃其中之一。量化则相对友好，因为它不改变维度。</p>\n<p>第三重纠缠回到异构：<a href=\"../foundations/data-heterogeneity\">SCAFFOLD</a> 为抗漂移让通信量翻倍，恰好和本篇的省通信目标对冲——抗异构精度与通信开销之间的权衡，是跨设备系统设计的永恒主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>跨设备联邦的命门是上行带宽，通信效率决定系统能否成立。</li>\n<li>两个正交旋钮：减少轮次（FedAvg 已做）与压缩每轮的量（本篇主题）。</li>\n<li>量化降比特、稀疏化只传 Top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>、低秩分解成瘦矩阵积，三者可叠加，多数需误差反馈防累积。</li>\n<li>压缩与差分隐私的噪声预算相互拉扯，必须把量化纳入隐私会计统一分析。</li>\n<li>稀疏化破坏安全聚合的维度对齐而天然冲突；抗异构算法又与省通信目标对冲。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"通信效率与压缩","id":"通信效率与压缩"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"量化：用更少比特表示每个数","id":"量化-用更少比特表示每个数"},{"level":2,"text":"稀疏化与低秩","id":"稀疏化与低秩"},{"level":2,"text":"压缩与隐私的纠缠","id":"压缩与隐私的纠缠"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"跨设备与跨机构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/federated-privacy-ml/systems/cross-device-silo"},"next":{"title":"个性化联邦","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/federated-privacy-ml/systems/personalization"}}